---
description: Recon and scrape limits.
alwaysApply: false
---

- Public pages only, unless `.orchestra/scope.md` names an owned, client, CTF, or open-source target.
- Stop at login, a paywall, a CAPTCHA, a robots disallow, or a 403 or 429.
- No stealth browser. No LinkedIn or Instagram scraper. Default rate is one request per second per domain.
